        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L46"
      },
      "rationale": "Answers a historical comparison that has no curator pin. Reserved artifacts without a pin, or recorded assessments with no owner reference, are unavailable; a captured channel is returned as recorded (so a measured empty collection stays measured); and a manifest that captured nothing is not_selected, with the explicit note that this does not mean no assessments existed.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    },
