      "id": "RLZ-Q309E7RB",
      "invariant": "INV-VXA7SZ0Z",
      "origin": {
        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L46"
      },
      "rationale": "Reads a closed leaf's assessments only through the single curator-record pin in its frozen comparison manifest. With no pin it defers to _without_pin, and competing pins are refused. The pinned generation is read through records_from_curator_generation and must match the manifest's reserved artifact set and frozen assessment count, so later pointer or source movement cannot change which judgments are shown.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    }
  ],
